      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.78
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "An information boundary was crossed when a PDF file leaked, revealing the exam's vulnerabilities. This act of trespass led the NTA to initiate a formal handover to the CBI, an internal review body, and resulted in the arrest of multiple suspects. The subsequent cancellation of the 2026 NEET-UG exam and the scheduling of a retest represent an attempt to repair the rules and navigate a new path forward, though the system's fault lines remain exposed.",
      "source": {
